\left(\mbox{det}\bsf{D}\right)^{-1/2} \left({\tau \over 4 \pi}\right)^{d/2} \times\\
e^{- {\tau \over 4} ({\bf V} - \bm{\Pi}^{-1} \cdot \bm{\mathcal{S}}_\tau(t))^T \bsf{D}^{-1}({\bf V} - \bm{\Pi}^{-1} \cdot \bm{\mathcal{S}}_\tau(t))}.
\end{eqnarray}
If the average  velocity of the particle in steady state is $ {\bf v}_0$, 
