&&-\Big((T-u)^{-n+1}-(T-u+\varepsilon )^{-n+1}\Big)+\Big((v-u)^{-n+1}-(v-u
\varepsilon )^{-n+1}\Big).
\end{eqnarray*
Since $K_{\varepsilon }(u,v,T)$ does not depend on $2n-2$ of the $u_{k}
